# Copy to `authorized_keys` (same directory) and put YOUR OpenSSH public key on
# the line below. wasted-provision.ps1 copies it to
# C:\ProgramData\ssh\administrators_authorized_keys on first boot and locks the
# ACL to SYSTEM + Administrators. Without it the box comes up with no SSH access
# and the provision run reports failure.
#
# ssh-ed25519 AAAA... you@your-machine
